### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare probe duration in milliseconds with readiness and dependency latency. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Registry/database contention, network delay or a slow endpoint.

### Fix
Resolve the measured dependency bottleneck and keep the probe endpoint representative.

### Verify
Probe duration returns below the threshold; confirm a real registry operation also succeeds. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
